-    *   **Quadtree:** Define the span-space bounds. If values are stored in $l$ bits, the range is $[0, 2^l - 1]$. The span-space is a $2^l \times 2^l$ region. Partition the region into four quadrants. Recursively subdivide quadrants containing mapped points until leaf nodes are reached. Handle collisions by storing a pointer to a list of cells mapped to the same span-space coordinate [S2].
